Description:
 linuxmuster-base7 - linuxmuster.net configuration scripts
Changes:
 linuxmuster-base7 (7.4.24) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(systemd): restart isc-dhcp-server on failure at boot - dhcpd could
     start before the server address was configured and then stayed down
     (#210, 1e22733).
   * fix(postinst): idempotent fix script for isc-dhcp-server restart -
     brings existing servers to the same state on package upgrade and
     starts dhcpd if it failed at the last boot (#210, 7709672).
   * fix(smb.conf): register only the server address as DC DNS records
     (#212, 8ea4203).
   * fix(postinst): idempotent fix script for samba dns registration
     (#212, 2d8c952).
   * fix(j_samba-provisioning): pin the host ip on domain provision
     (#212, 721ca60).
   * fix(import_subnets): report firewall API auth failures instead of a
     version error (#214, 47029bc).
   * feat(opnsense_apikey): add linuxmuster-opnsense-apikey to deploy a new
     firewall API key (#214, 401dd16).
